{"id": "sm2-0376", "domain": "recipe", "names": ["Cocoa", "Milk", "Mug"], "text": "hot chocolate. Cocoa and Milk both go into the Mug. Wire them. Tint the Mug white, huge. Tell me the Mug's size and its colour. Is Cocoa brown?", "wires": [{"span": "Cocoa and Milk both go into the Mug", "trigger": "go into", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Cocoa,Milk", "to": "Mug"}}, {"span": "Tint the Mug white, huge", "trigger": "Tint", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mug", "color": "white", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "Tell me the Mug's size", "trigger": "size", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Mug", "property": "size"}}, {"span": "its colour", "trigger": "colour", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Mug", "property": "color"}}, {"span": "Is Cocoa brown", "trigger": "Is", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Cocoa", "color": "brown"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0377", "domain": "UI wireframe", "names": ["Title", "Body", "Foot"], "text": "slide template. Place Title at the top, Body at the center and Foot at the bottom. Make the Body huge. Label Foot with the page number 7. Which is bigger, Body or Title? Is Body bigger than Title?", "wires": [{"span": "Place Title at the top", "trigger": "Place", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Title", "position": "top"}}, {"span": "Body at the center", "trigger": "center", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Body", "position": "center"}}, {"span": "Foot at the bottom", "trigger": "at the bottom", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Foot", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Make the Body huge", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Body", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "Label Foot with the page number 7", "trigger": "Label", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Foot", "label": "7"}}, {"span": "Is Body bigger than Title", "trigger": "bigger than", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Body", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Title"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0378", "domain": "kanban board", "names": ["Col1", "Col2", "Col3"], "text": "quick board. Col1 is gold. Col2 is gold as well. Col3 is not gold. Link Col1 to Col2 with a dashed arrow. Are there any gold shapes? How many?", "wires": [{"span": "Col1 is gold", "trigger": "is", "type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Col1", "color": "gold"}}, {"span": "Col2 is gold as well", "trigger": "is", "type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Col2", "color": "gold"}}, {"span": "Link Col1 to Col2 with a dashed arrow", "trigger": "Link", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Col1", "to": "Col2", "style": "dashed"}}, {"span": "Are there any gold shapes", "trigger": "Are there", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "gold"}}, {"span": "How many", "trigger": "How many", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "gold"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0379", "domain": "game map", "names": ["Spawn", "Chest", "Boss"], "text": "dungeon crawler. From the Spawn you walk to the Chest and then to the Boss. Draw that path with arrows. Move the Boss way up, 180 pixels. Make the Chest gold. What can I reach from Spawn? And what's closest to the Boss?", "wires": [{"span": "From the Spawn you walk to the Chest and then to the Boss. Draw that path with arrows", "trigger": "Draw", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Spawn,Chest,Boss", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Move the Boss way up, 180 pixels", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Boss", "direction": "up", "distance": "180"}}, {"span": "Make the Chest gold", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Chest", "color": "gold"}}, {"span": "What can I reach from Spawn", "trigger": "reach", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Spawn"}}, {"span": "what's closest to the Boss", "trigger": "closest", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Boss", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0380", "domain": "cloud architecture", "names": ["Zone1", "Zone2", "Zone3"], "text": "region layout. Fan out from Zone1 to Zone2 and Zone3. Plain lines please, no arrowheads. Then put Zone2 and Zone3 side by side in a row. Is the Zone1 the topmost? Count how many links Zone1 has.", "wires": [{"span": "Fan out from Zone1 to Zone2 and Zone3", "trigger": "Fan out", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Zone1", "to": "Zone2,Zone3", "arrow": "none"}}, {"span": "put Zone2 and Zone3 side by side in a row", "trigger": "in a row", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Zone2,Zone3", "layout": "row"}}, {"span": "Is the Zone1 the topmost", "trigger": "topmost", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "topmost"}}, {"span": "Count how many links Zone1 has", "trigger": "how many links", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Zone1"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0381", "domain": "family tree", "names": ["Oma", "Mutti", "Kind"], "text": "let me sort my family tree. Oma goes to Mutti and Mutti goes to Kind. Hmm, that was just my guess; undo that. Wire Oma straight to Kind instead? Hmm, no, redo the first one. Is Mutti linked to Kind?", "wires": [{"span": "Oma goes to Mutti and Mutti goes to Kind", "trigger": "goes to", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Oma,Mutti,Kind", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "undo that", "trigger": "undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}, {"span": "redo the first one", "trigger": "redo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "redo"}}, {"span": "Is Mutti linked to Kind", "trigger": "linked to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Mutti", "anchor": "Kind"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0382", "domain": "school diagram", "names": ["Pitch", "Tone", "Volume"], "text": "physics of sound. Shove Pitch to the far left. Park Volume at the far right and Tone in the center. Colour them all different: Pitch red, Tone yellow, Volume blue. Which one is the rightmost?", "wires": [{"span": "Shove Pitch to the far left", "trigger": "Shove", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Pitch", "position": "left"}}, {"span": "Park Volume at the far right", "trigger": "Park", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Volume", "position": "right"}}, {"span": "Tone in the center", "trigger": "in the center", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tone", "position": "center"}}, {"span": "Colour them all different: Pitch red", "trigger": "Colour", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pitch", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Tone yellow", "trigger": "Tone", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tone", "color": "yellow"}}, {"span": "Volume blue", "trigger": "Volume", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Volume", "color": "blue"}}, {"span": "Which one is the rightmost", "trigger": "rightmost", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "rightmost"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0383", "domain": "pipeline", "names": ["Plan", "Do"], "text": "tiny pipeline. Plan feeds Do. Throw in a gray circle named Check below Do, and another gray one named Act below Check. Hook Do to Check and Check to Act. Everything gray should be small, from now on. How many gray circles?", "wires": [{"span": "Plan feeds Do", "trigger": "feeds", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Plan", "to": "Do"}}, {"span": "Throw in a gray circle named Check below Do", "trigger": "Throw in", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "gray", "name": "Check", "position": "below", "anchor": "Do"}}, {"span": "another gray one named Act below Check", "trigger": "another gray one", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "gray", "name": "Act", "position": "below", "anchor": "$new"}}, {"span": "Hook Do to Check and Check to Act", "trigger": "Hook", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Do,$new,$new", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "How many gray circles", "trigger": "How many", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "gray", "shape": "circle"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0384", "domain": "sports play", "names": ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Q4"], "text": "quarters of a game. Line Q1, Q2, Q3 and Q4 up in a row, and chain them with arrows. Zap the link from Q2 to Q3, halftime. Is Q4 reachable from Q1 still? Can I reach Q2 from Q1?", "wires": [{"span": "Line Q1, Q2, Q3 and Q4 up in a row", "trigger": "Line", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Q1,Q2,Q3,Q4", "layout": "row"}}, {"span": "chain them with arrows", "trigger": "chain", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Q1,Q2,Q3,Q4", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Zap the link from Q2 to Q3", "trigger": "Zap", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Q2", "to": "Q3"}}, {"span": "Is Q4 reachable from Q1 still", "trigger": "reachable", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Q1", "to": "Q4"}}, {"span": "Can I reach Q2 from Q1", "trigger": "reach", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Q1", "to": "Q2"}}]}
