{"id": "sm2-0396", "domain": "network diagram", "names": ["Ext", "Fw", "Lan"], "text": "traffic must go through the firewall. Ext to Fw, Fw to Lan, one after the other. Make sure Ext and Lan do not touch. Is Ext connected to Lan? Draw the first as dashed; drop the second link if Ext touches Lan.", "wires": [{"span": "Ext to Fw, Fw to Lan, one after the other", "trigger": "one after the other", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ext,Fw,Lan", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Is Ext connected to Lan", "trigger": "connected to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Ext", "anchor": "Lan"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0397", "domain": "school diagram", "names": ["Sun", "Planet", "Moon"], "text": "orbit diagram. Planet orbits Sun, Moon orbits Planet. Link them in a chain. Shrink Moon, enlarge Sun. Is the Sun now the biggest? Is the Moon the smallest?", "wires": [{"span": "Link them in a chain", "trigger": "Link", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Sun,Planet,Moon", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Shrink Moon", "trigger": "Shrink", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Moon"}}, {"span": "enlarge Sun", "trigger": "enlarge", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Sun"}}, {"span": "Is the Sun now the biggest", "trigger": "biggest", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}, {"span": "Is the Moon the smallest", "trigger": "smallest", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "smallest"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0398", "domain": "floor plan", "names": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "text": "cubicles. Arrange A, B, C and D in a grid. Move D to the bottom right. Make A and B red; C and D blue. Which shapes are red? How many are blue?", "wires": [{"span": "Arrange A, B, C and D in a grid", "trigger": "Arrange", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "A,B,C,D", "layout": "grid"}}, {"span": "Move D to the bottom right", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "D", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"span": "Make A and B red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "A,B", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "C and D blue", "trigger": "C", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "C,D", "color": "blue"}}, {"span": "Which shapes are red", "trigger": "Which shapes", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "How many are blue", "trigger": "How many", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "blue"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0399", "domain": "pipeline", "names": ["Job1", "Job2", "Job3"], "text": "batch jobs. Job1, Job2 and Job3 run one after the other, so connect them in a chain. Then Job3 should loop back to Job1, so wire that. Cycle check please. Axe the loop link if there is a cycle, then undo the axe.", "wires": [{"span": "connect them in a chain", "trigger": "connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Job1,Job2,Job3", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "wire that", "trigger": "wire", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Job3", "to": "Job1"}}, {"span": "Cycle check please", "trigger": "Cycle", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}, {"span": "Axe the loop link if there is a cycle", "trigger": "Axe", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Job3", "to": "Job1"}}, {"span": "then undo the axe", "trigger": "undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
{"id": "sm2-0400", "domain": "sports play", "names": ["Gk", "Cb", "Fwd"], "text": "final formation. Pass chain: Gk, Cb, Fwd each to the next. Park Fwd at the top and Gk at the bottom. Send Cb to the back. Is the Cb nearer to Gk or Fwd? Which is the closest to Cb?", "wires": [{"span": "Pass chain: Gk, Cb, Fwd each to the next", "trigger": "chain", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Gk,Cb,Fwd", "pairing": "next"}}, {"span": "Park Fwd at the top", "trigger": "Park", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Fwd", "position": "top"}}, {"span": "Gk at the bottom", "trigger": "at the bottom", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Gk", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Send Cb to the back", "trigger": "to the back", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Cb"}}, {"span": "Which is the closest to Cb", "trigger": "closest", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Cb", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
